@startuml C1_Generate_Operation_Plans_Logical_View
title C1 – Generate Operation Plans (Context View)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

cloud "Identity Provider\n(OAuth 2.0 / OIDC)" as IAM
cloud "OEM Planning & Scheduling Service" as OEM
rectangle "Port Logistics Management System (PLMS)" as PLMS {
  rectangle "Angular SPA\n(Operation Plans Generation UI)" as SPA
  rectangle "TodoApi\n(OEM Proxy API)" as API
  database "Reference Catalog Cache" as Cache
}

Operator --> SPA : Browser (HTTPS)
SPA --> API : REST JSON (with credentials)
API --> IAM : Validate identity headers
API --> OEM : Forward preview/generate requests
SPA --> Cache : Retrieve resources/VVNs for display
Operator --> IAM : Login / SSO
OEM --> API : Plans, metadata, warnings

@enduml
